  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> is a complex number satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, then the sum of the absolute values of the imaginary parts of the roots of the equation is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> <em>or</em> <math><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></math><br />Hence, the required sum is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  }
